message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "memga: Multiple Choice Method for selecting sets of alternatives"
abstract: >-
  Selects a set of alternatives that complement each other, instead of ranking the
  alternatives one by one. Implements the Multiple Choice Method (MEM) and an adaptation
  for larger problems, with an exhaustive search and a genetic algorithm. Available for
  Python, R, MATLAB and GNU Octave.
